OL,3,GNEWSAAlmost 4,000 homes could be built
OL,4,Aby university
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build almost 4,000 new homes
OL,7,Fon the outskirts of Cambridge have been
OL,8,Frecommended for approval.
OL,10,FThe University of Cambridge wants to
OL,11,Fbuild up to 3,800 more homes, alongside
OL,12,Fnew employment and academic space, as
OL,13,Fpart of the next phase of its Eddington
OL,14,Fdevelopment.
OL,16,FMore than 90 objections have been
OL,17,Fraised, according to a report,
OL,18,Fincluding concerns about the height of
OL,19,Fsome buildings and the amount of green
OL,20,Fspace available in the area.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
